  book_title: The Spirit of Flowers
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: 104
  content: This book explores the symbolism behind some unusual traits of flowers,
    offering a philosophical perspective.
  clue_content: "Chapter Five: The Courage to Bloom Toward the Sun\nNo flower blooms
    forever. Some seem to embrace this truth more fiercely. They are drawn to sunlight
    by nature, the more sunlight they receive, the more brilliantly they bloom, yet
    the sooner they fade \u2014as though living only for that one radiant moment."
